  "Solution": "The requested expression contains twice \\(2x\\), so finding \\(2x\\) is enough. Subtracting \\(1\\) from both sides of the given equation gives \\(2x=7\\). Therefore,\n\\[\n4x+1=2(2x)+1=2\\cdot7+1=15.\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(15\\), choice A.",
